    "body": "@JSwetz, a heads-up to save you a round: this one and #3880 conflict with main only in the **3D rough-finish catalog case** (`examples/catalog/3d/rough-finish/rough-finish.camproj`/`.nc`, and for #3880 `crates/app/tests/example_catalog/case_3d_rough_finish.rs`). Main's #3857 (3D Pocket re-entry takes the entry) changed those goldens at 06:0x UTC. A `git merge upstream/main` and regenerating that case's golden should clear both. #3881 and #3883 conflict in `crates/app/tests/mcp_live/ui_link.rs`, likely with each other's or a merged neighbour's test. None of the four has a review yet; once they merge cleanly, reviews start right away. Thanks for taking the P3 bugs!\n",
